## Implementation

Create `apps/work-control/docs/collaboration.md`:

```markdown
# Collaboration Rules — work-control

## Presence model (S12)
- Awareness-only: multiple users CAN view and interact simultaneously
- No edit-locking, no pessimistic concurrency (S12-INVARIANTS §3)
- Human presence: ephemeral tab ID; label "User XXXX" (pre-auth)
- Agent presence: visible during task run; role badge; auto-clears on done
- Pre-auth: all users anonymous. After S15 auth: real identity.

## Who sees whom
| Actor | Sees | When |
|-------|------|------|
| Human (chat) | Other viewers on same chat | Always while subscribed |
| Human (board) | Other viewers + running agents | Always while subscribed |
| Agent | Does NOT subscribe — server pushes its presence | During task run only |

## Collaboration invariants
- Last-write-wins on task status (no lock)
- Open-gate is idempotent (flip OPEN→OPEN twice is safe)
- Run task is idempotent per task: already-done tasks skip re-run (S08 invariant)
- Presence is volatile: server restart clears all presence

## Future (S13+)
- S15: Real user identity via OAuth session
- S13: Agent-to-agent handoff visible in presence (lead + helpers)
- S-future: typing indicators, collaborative editing
```

